message: "If you publish results from this calculator or a copy of it, please cite it and name the source snapshot."
title: "Oregon Universal Health Plan explainer and calculator (unofficial)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Malcom
    given-names: Marcus
    affiliation: Malcom IO LLC
repository-code: "https://github.com/Malcom-IO/oregon-uhp-explainer"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A plain-language explainer and household calculator for Oregon's proposed
  Universal Health Plan. It applies the five financing models in the Universal
  Health Plan Governance Board's October 2026 draft report. Unofficial: not
  published, reviewed or endorsed by the Board or the State of Oregon.
